# Fix Manage Data Dropdowns & Field Order

The user reported that the Activity, Division, and Region dropdowns on the Manage Data page (Production tab) don't match the rest of the tool. Additionally, the field order in Region Management needs to be updated to match the requested flow: Activity -> Division -> Region.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will be updating the [Activity](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/server.js#929-944) and [Division](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/new/client/src/pages/DashboardEnhanced.jsx#435-438) labels to be more descriptive (e.g., "EP" -> "Exploration & Production") and ensuring they match the Sonatrach corporate structure.

## Proposed Changes

### [ManageData.jsx](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/new/client/src/pages/ManageData.jsx)

